Conflicts: ubuntu-builder
Replaces: ubuntu-builder
Description: build your own Ubuntu based distribution
 OS Builder is an application which allows you to completely build an
 Ubuntu based distribution: pick an official release (fetched live from
 ubuntu.com) or a local ISO, customize it — packages, desktop environment,
 boot menu and splash, wallpaper, installer, your own commands — through a
 chroot console, Synaptic or the nested desktop, and build a hybrid ISO
 that boots on legacy BIOS and UEFI with Secure Boot.
